I wouldn't be so sure.  It depends what you define as baddest.  I haven't 
played Nethack in a while, but in 3.1.0 I did some tests for raw killing 
power.  Here are some minor spoilers:

I polymorphed myself into a marilith (a demon), and wore boots of speed.  This 
gave me 6 attacks for the opponents' 1.  The sword which I noticed killed 
monsters the fastest (including the wizard) was:

+5 FrostBrand.  It works well for the following reasons:

- very few monsters are Frost resistant (including the Wizard) so the 
  bonuses you get from the sword is very high.  On the other hand, more 
  monsters (especially in hell) are fire resistant, so that is why a 
  FireBrand isn't as good.

- Although Stormbringer has a good chance of draining the level of an 
  opponent (at 6 attacks a round it drains them reallty fast) I found the 
  FrostBrand was still doing the most damage.

I posted the actual results of my test about a year or so ago, maybe I'll 
rerun it.

Basically if you are a neutral character, and get a FrostBrand, don't 
scuff your feet and say "Gee wiz, I don't have any good weapons."  I 
found it works pretty well, especially versus the wizard.

